WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.055 --> 00:00:10.755
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE MIGRANT CARAVAN

00:00:10.756 --> 00:00:12.123
FROM HONDURAS WAS HEADED FOR

00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:13.357
THIS COUNTRY BUT STOPPED SHORT

00:00:13.358 --> 00:00:15.126
IN MEXICO AND IS NOW OCCUPYING

00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:17.895
THE BORDER CITY OF TIJUANA.

00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:19.230
LOCAL RESIDENTS AND TIJUANA ARE

00:00:19.231 --> 00:00:20.131
GETTING INCREASINGLY FED UP

00:00:20.132 --> 00:00:24.869
ABOUT ITS PRESENCE.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:25.803
HE RECENTLY SAID THE CARAVAN

00:00:25.804 --> 00:00:29.640
LEADERS TRICK PEOPLE INTO

00:00:29.641 --> 00:00:31.909
TRAVELING NORTH WITH FALSE

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:32.276
PROMISES.

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:33.945
HE ALSO SAYS A CARAVAN WOULD BE

00:00:33.946 --> 00:00:34.645
BETTER OFF RETURNING TO THEIR

00:00:34.646 --> 00:00:43.154
HOME COUNTRIES.

00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:47.325
&gt;&gt; I'M LOOKING AT A PICTURE OF

00:00:47.326 --> 00:00:48.693
YOU WITH SOME KIND OF ENCAMPMENT

00:00:48.694 --> 00:00:49.727
BEHIND YOU.

00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:51.095
CAN YOU TELL OUR VIEWERS WHAT

00:00:51.096 --> 00:00:54.265
YOU ARE LOOKING AT?

00:00:54.266 --> 00:00:58.235
&gt;&gt; WE ARE LOOKING AT A FACILITY

00:00:58.236 --> 00:00:59.136
THAT IS LIKE AN EMERGENCY

00:00:59.137 --> 00:01:07.678
CHAPTER FOR THEM.

00:01:07.679 --> 00:01:12.383
THEY ARE GOING TO TRY TO CROSS

00:01:12.384 --> 00:01:14.885
THROUGH THE BEACH, OR JUMP THE

00:01:14.886 --> 00:01:15.653
FENCE.

00:01:15.654 --> 00:01:20.524
YOU HAVE TO BRING THEM OVER HER

00:01:20.525 --> 00:01:23.561
HERE, AND THEY WERE GETTING MAD

00:01:23.562 --> 00:01:28.165
AND THEY EVEN STARTED THROWING

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:35.139
STONES AT EACH OTHER.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.140
THEY KEPT GROWING AND GROWING.

00:01:36.141 --> 00:01:39.276
BUT WHEN WE WERE CARRYING THE

00:01:39.277 --> 00:01:42.146
FINANCIAL LOAD OF KEEPING THESE

00:01:42.147 --> 00:01:43.714
PEOPLE WITH MEDICINE AND FOOD

00:01:43.715 --> 00:01:51.722
AND SHELTER, AND ITS -- &gt;&gt; I'M

00:01:51.723 --> 00:01:52.723
SORRY TO INTERRUPT BUT BEHIND

00:01:52.724 --> 00:01:54.625
YOU IT SEEMS THAT SOMEONE IS

00:01:54.626 --> 00:01:55.226
CLEANING UP GARBAGE.

00:01:55.227 --> 00:01:59.096
IS THERE LOTS OF TRASH THERE?

00:01:59.097 --> 00:01:59.797
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A LOT OF TRASH

00:01:59.798 --> 00:02:02.066
BECAUSE WHAT I TRY TO TELL YOU,

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:06.704
THE 360 GREW TO 6300.

00:02:06.705 --> 00:02:10.808
SO WE HAD ANOTHER, IT'S A BIG

00:02:10.809 --> 00:02:14.178
CONCERT HALL WHERE YOU CAN HAVE

00:02:14.179 --> 00:02:15.880
LIKE 10,000 PEOPLE.

00:02:15.881 --> 00:02:17.214
WE SENT THEM OVER HERE BUT IT

00:02:17.215 --> 00:02:19.216
HAS TO BE VOLUNTARY BECAUSE THE

00:02:19.217 --> 00:02:21.552
PEOPLE FROM HUMAN RIGHTS, THEY

00:02:21.553 --> 00:02:22.853
HAVE THEIR DELEGATES HERE, TOO.

00:02:22.854 --> 00:02:27.324
AND THEY WANT TO -- THEY WANTED

00:02:27.325 --> 00:02:28.693
TO TREAT THEM TOO KINDLY.

00:02:28.694 --> 00:02:32.129
SO THERE ARE LIKE 1500 PEOPLE

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.264
HERE, 2200 PEOPLE THERE AND

00:02:33.265 --> 00:02:36.767
THERE ARE LIKE 2,000 PEOPLE THAT

00:02:36.768 --> 00:02:40.871
AREN'T ACCOUNTED FOR.

00:02:40.872 --> 00:02:42.339
&gt;&gt; Tucker: UNACCOUNTED FOR.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.408
SO BASICALLY YOU HAVE ILLEGAL

00:02:44.409 --> 00:02:47.144
ALIENS FROM HONDURAS IN TIJUANA.

00:02:47.145 --> 00:02:48.312
HOW DO YOU FEEL ABOUT THAT?

00:02:48.313 --> 00:02:50.047
&gt;&gt; WHILE I HAVE HEARD THAT LIKE

00:02:50.048 --> 00:02:57.154
THE BORDER PATROL HAS BEEN GOING

00:02:57.155 --> 00:02:57.655
UP IN DETENTIONS.

00:02:57.656 --> 00:03:00.057
LIKE 150 MORE THAN THEY ARE USED

