00:03:33.325 --> 00:03:35.292
200 HAVE BEEN REPATRIATED HOME

00:03:35.293 --> 00:03:37.728
VOLUNTARILY AND WE HAVE DEPORTED

00:03:37.729 --> 00:03:38.529
