00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.197
THERE HAVE BEEN LIKE 236

00:03:40.198 --> 00:03:45.770
DETAINED BY POLICE AND WE SEND

00:03:45.771 --> 00:03:47.872
THEM THROUGH THE IMMIGRATION

00:03:47.873 --> 00:03:48.372
SYSTEM.

00:03:48.373 --> 00:03:49.406
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT SO YOU ARE

00:03:49.407 --> 00:03:51.375
DEALING WITH SEVERAL THOUSAND

00:03:51.376 --> 00:03:52.476
UNWANTED IMMIGRANTS IN TIJUANA.

00:03:52.477 --> 00:03:54.078
THE UNITED STATES RIGHT NOW HAS

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:56.113
ABOUT 22 MILLION ILLEGAL

00:03:56.114 --> 00:03:58.649
IMMIGRANTS            ALIENS

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.717
LIVING WITHIN OUR BORDERS.

00:03:59.718 --> 00:04:01.752
CAN YOU UNDERSTAND IT, NOW THAT

00:04:01.753 --> 00:04:03.387
YOU ARE SEEING THIS FIRST HAND,

00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:06.524
THE FRUSTRATION OF SOME

00:04:06.525 --> 00:04:08.292
AMERICANS ABOUT THAT?

00:04:08.293 --> 00:04:11.962
&gt;&gt; THE PEOPLE FROM TIJUANA ARE

00:04:11.963 --> 00:04:12.363
FRUSTRATED.

00:04:12.364 --> 00:04:13.631
THESE PEOPLE CAME HERE LEGALLY,

00:04:13.632 --> 00:04:17.935
THEY WENT TO OUR BORDER AND THEY

00:04:17.936 --> 00:04:21.739
STARTED WITH A WORK VISA, A

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.406
