00:04:25.977 --> 00:04:33.350
TO DO THEIR PAPERWORK ALSO TO GO

00:04:33.351 --> 00:04:35.553
LEGALLY INTO THE UNITED STATES.

00:04:35.554 --> 00:04:36.720
