00:04:46.932 --> 00:04:49.133
WORKING THERE AND THEY HAVE

00:04:49.134 --> 00:04:50.267
VISAS FOR THAT.

00:04:50.268 --> 00:04:52.136
BUT THESE GUYS DIDN'T CROSS

00:04:52.137 --> 00:04:53.971
LEGALLY INTO MEXICO.

00:04:53.972 --> 00:04:56.574
THEY TORE DOWN OUR BORDER AND

00:04:56.575 --> 00:05:03.314
JUMPED.

00:05:03.315 --> 00:05:07.318
THAT -- THAT SYMPATHETIC.

00:05:07.319 --> 00:05:09.053
&gt;&gt; SO FINALLY HOW ARE YOU GOING

00:05:09.054 --> 00:05:10.554
TO RESPOND WHEN THIS HAPPENS

00:05:10.555 --> 00:05:11.322
AGAIN BECAUSE THIS WILL NOT

00:05:11.323 --> 00:05:12.690
LIKELY BE THE LAST CARAVAN THAT

00:05:12.691 --> 00:05:19.129
COMES THROUGH TIJUANA?

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.398
&gt;&gt; THIS PRESIDENT HAS A VERY

00:05:21.399 --> 00:05:23.601
