00:05:23.935 --> 00:05:26.303
THIS PRESIDENT SAYS WELCOME, WE

00:05:26.304 --> 00:05:29.206
ARE GIVING YOU A JOB AND WILL

00:05:29.207 --> 00:05:33.177
CREATE OPPORTUNITIES FOR YOU.

00:05:33.178 --> 00:05:38.949
AND IN TIJUANA WE ARE WORRIED

